Try using sprintf() for general string creations via C-style.

string <- sprintf('F = 1 -%i
         PRIOR = (1 - %i, a1, lnorm, 0, 0.5),(1 - %i,g, norm, -1.386294, 0.5)',
        nItems,nItems,nItems)
mirt.model(string)

HTH.

Phil

