>             [,1]      [,2]
>  [1,] 1.08624628 1.3448732
>  [2,]     ...       ...
>
> Do a1,a2 in the output of coef-method correspond to column 1,2 of the a matrix respectively?
>
> $Item_1
>        a1    a2      d g u
> par 1.318 1.369 -1.205 0 1
>
> Or is the order not preserved, only the magnitudes?

Correct. Only asymptotically will the order of these parameters converge to the ordered pattern in the population. It's possible to estimate these parameters under constraints that the ordering is preserved, but that's actually relatively complicated to do and generally not recommended. HTH.

Phil

